AUDIO: 'This is not what this says. Their definition of commercial purpose includes production use, using it in a product or a service, hosting it behind an API. And then there\'s the part that really just kicks in here. As if that'

[07:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'wasn\'t already enough, it also includes using the outputs for any internal operations beyond limited evaluation. The outputs. Okay, so, what does this actually mean? Not just the model itself, the audio it generates. And this'

[07:27] [scene:talk]
