AUDIO: 'whole thing just keeps going. There\'s no creator exception, no small business exception, there\'s no revenue threshold, there\'s nothing here. A lot of non-commercial licenses leave some gray'

[07:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'area, this one goes out of its way to basically block a lot of that. So, let\'s make this more practical now. When could you use this? Put a generated Breeze voice inside a product? Nope, that\'s not going to happen.'

